title: "nf-rna"
version: "1.6.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "nf-rna Contributors"
abstract: "A versioned, provenance-oriented control plane for bulk RNA-seq FASTQ and raw-count projects on Linux/WSL2 with Nextflow and Conda, with Salmon and HISAT2 + featureCounts backends, interactive or explicit project creation, and an optional local browser GUI."
